+    // The unsigned high half of a 64x64 product. ARM64 spells this umulh;
+    // POWER spells it mulhdu. AssemblyHelpers::rapidHashMix64 needs it to
+    // fold lo^hi, and its ARM64 arm is otherwise architecture-neutral.
+    void uMulHigh64(RegisterID left, RegisterID right, RegisterID dest)
